new file mode 100644
index 000000000..4c071b2ae
--- /dev/null
+++ b/platform/ENTRY_GUIDE.md
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+# Platform change entries
+
+For a feature or fix to shared BigCherry tooling, include a concise Markdown
+note under `platform/changes/` in the same PR and commit as the implementation.
+Use an issue- or feature-specific filename, for example
+`shared-build-graph.md`. State the user-visible platform effect and its
+validation. Engine-specific patches, GPU kernels, model measurements and
+documentation do **not** need entries here.
+
+This entry is the deliberate release trigger. The release-state files are
+excluded so that editing notes and versions cannot cause a fresh release.
+The commit subject, not the
+entry's prose, supplies the version bump and changelog text to release-please.
+Do not put secret values, machine paths or raw logs in the entry.
